Nick Ducoff, GM of Institutional Growth at Solana, on DTCC coming to Solana in 2027.

“Over four quadrillion dollars in transactions were processed last year by the DTCC. When it connects a tokenization service to a network like Solana, it signals to the entire industry that tokenized securities are becoming real market infrastructure. This is not a pilot."

@nickducoff @The_DTCC @TheBlockCo
